alues:\n```\n  79\n+ 88\n-----\n```\n\nNext, we add the digits in the ones place:\n```\n  9 + 8 = 17\n```\nWe write down 7 and carry over 1 to the tens place.\n\nNow, we add the digits in the tens place along with the carry-over:\n```\n  7 + 8 + 1 = 16\n```\nWe write down 6 and carry over 1 to the hundreds place.\n\nSince there are no more digits to add, we write down the carry-over in the hundreds place.\n\nSo, the sum of 79 and 88 is:\n```\n  79\n+ 88\n-----\n 167\n```\n\nTherefore, the final answer is 167.\n</answer>",
